Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.00,Credit,,0,0,0,,字幕制作：测试样本组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.20,Han,,0,0,0,,你今天怎么这么早就起来了\N{\rEN}Why are you up so early today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.00,Han,,0,0,0,,我睡不着 干脆起来煮点咖啡\N{\rEN}I couldn't sleep, so I figured I'd make some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.80,Han,,0,0,0,,你要不要也来一杯 我煮了一大壶\N够我们两个人喝一整个上午\N{\rEN}Do you want a cup too? I made a big pot, enough for both of us to drink all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,Han,,0,0,0,,好啊 - 加不加糖\N{\rEN}- Sure. - Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.50,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（水壶鸣响）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:17.60,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[kettle whistling]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.50,Han,,0,0,0,,楼下那家店的新iPhone壳打八折\N我昨天顺手买了一个\N{\rEN}The shop downstairs has phone cases at 20% off, so I grabbed one yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,Han,,0,0,0,,一共是128.50元 比网上便宜了差不多30块\N{\rEN}It came to 128.50 in total, about 30 cheaper than online.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.00,Han,,0,0,0,,说明书上写着去\Nhttps://example.com/help/setup?step=2 下载App\N{\rEN}The manual says to go to https://example.com/help/setup?step=2 and get the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:31.00,Han,,0,0,0,,营业时间 9:00-21:00
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.10,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}OPEN 9 AM - 9 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:35.00,Han,,0,0,0,,其实我一直想跟你说 下个月我\N可能要搬到离公司近一点的地方去住\N{\rEN}I might move closer to work next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.20,EN,,0,0,0,,There's something I've been meaning to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.00,Han,,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\rEN}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.00,Han,,0,0,0,,嗯 每天通勤两个小时 实在是太累了\N{\rEN}Yeah. Two hours of commuting every day is just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ 窗外的雨一直下 ♪\N{\rLyrics_EN}♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.80,Han,,0,0,0,,那周末我帮你一起看房子吧\N顺便去吃那家我们一直说要去的面馆\N{\rEN}Then let me help you look at places this weekend,\Nand we can finally try that noodle place we keep talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.00,Han,,0,0,0,,好 就这么说定了！\N{\rEN}Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.50,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[door closes]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.00,Han,,0,0,0,,她走了以后，房间突然安静了下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.00,Han,,0,0,0,,喂？我在家 你到楼下了吗\N{\rEN}Hello? I'm home. Are you downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.50,Han,,0,0,0,,我马上下来\N{\rEN}I'll come down.
